=2 Rhapsodies of Vanadiel
{p:Curio Vendor Moogles|Curio Vendor Moogle} will sell the {p:Key Item} reward once {k:"Rhapsody in Azure"} is obtained from {p:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel}.
=2 Walkthrough
* Enter Naja's office to start the quest.
* Trade 3 {i:Imperial Gold Pieces|Imperial Gold Piece|2187} to {n:Abquhbah}, he will give you the {k:Officer Academy manual}.
* Trade 2 {i:Imperial Mythril Pieces|Imperial Mythril Piece|2186} to {n:Abquhbah} to start the first trial.

\**Trial 1: Memory{br}** You will be shown a scene for a short period of time, and then asked questions about the scene. Get them all right to pass.
Scene 1
:* You will be asked what kind of critters were shown to you.
:* You will be asked how many critters there were in the scene.

Scene 2
:* You will be asked twice how many critters are facing left, right, up or down.

Scene 3
:* You will be asked how many critters there were in the scene.

* Trade 2 {i:Imperial Mythril Pieces|Imperial Mythril Piece|2186} to {n:Abquhbah} to start the second trial.

\**Trial 2: Proof of competence{br}** You will be asked to retrieve a proof of your competence, namely a piece of Beastmen equipment, to then trade to {n:Abquhbah}.
* Examples include:
** {i:Macuahuitl -1|Macuahuitl -1|17716}
** {i:Mamool Ja Collar|Mamool Ja Collar|2227}
** {i:Mamool Ja Helmet|Mamool Ja Helmet|2162}
** {i:Jadagna -1|Jadagna -1|18409}
** {i:Januwiyah -1|Januwiyah -1|16166}
** {i:Tariqah -1|Tariqah -1|16167}
** {i:Troll Pauldron|Troll Pauldron|2160}
** {i:Troll Vambrace|Troll Vambrace|2161}
** {i:Lamian Armlet|Lamian Armlet|2167}
** {p:Lamian Kaman -1}
** {i:Qutrub Gorget|Qutrub Gorget|2165}
* Upgraded beastmen items (such as {p:Lamian Kaman} or {p:Lamian Kaman +1|Lamian Kaman Plus 1}) will not work.
* Beastmen items from the west ({p:Yagudo|Category:Yagudo}, {p:Orc|Category:Orc}, {p:Goblin|Category:Goblin}, et cetera) will not work.

* Trade 2 {i:Imperial Mythril Pieces|Imperial Mythril Piece|2186} to {n:Abquhbah} to start the third trial.

\**Trial 3: Trivia{br}** You will be asked 8 trivia questions. Get at least 7 correct to pass. The answers are below:
+ Fulfill requests without fail.
+ Bigger than a Marid.
+ Mythralline Wellspring.
+ A detective agency.
+ Empyrean Incense.
+ Warjal.
+ Blackrust.
+ He tripped over his right foot.

* After all 3 trials are complete, you will be awarded your promotion.
** If you fail any trial, you will need to pay the initiation fee of 2 {i:Imperial Mythril Pieces|Imperial Mythril Piece|2186} again in order to repeat it.

